<title>SWEDEN: Astra tumbles on H1 U.S. Losec sales.</title>
<headline>Astra tumbles on H1 U.S. Losec sales.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish drug company Astra's shares fell on Thursday after the company announced a 28 percent rise in sales of its anti-ulcer drug Losec in the U.S. in the first half of 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;We had expected a sales increase of about 40 percent,&quot; said one broker.</p>
<p>At 1210 GMT Astra shares were 5.5 crowns lower at 151.5 crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
